6-07-07T03:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>WOC. Meanwhile worked to L/O 7in tubing from derrick. Layed out 1x stand.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-07T03:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-07T03:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>WOC. Meanwhile worked to install bolt on TDS blower cabinet</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-07T03:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-07T04:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>WOC. Meanwhile worked to L/O 7in tubing from derrick. Layed out 2x stands.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-07T04:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-07T05:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pressure tested surface cement plug against closed shear ram. Attempted to test twice. Pressure broke off around 30-40bar and leaked off. After second attempt started loosing fluid into the well around 1,6m3/hour</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-07T05:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-07T16:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Continued to layout 7in pipe from derrick. Layed out 9x stands. Meanwhile continued w/ maintenance work on TDS and DW. Function tested BOP. Continued preparation to N/D BOP. Losses 1,6m3/hour. Meamwhile evaluated with onshore organization further plans</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-07T16:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-07T16:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting prior to run RTTS plug</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-07T16:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-07T18:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mechanical plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH 3x stands 8,25in DC and RTTS BHA. Losses 1,6m3/hour</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-07T18:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-07T18:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">132</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH on 5,5in DP to 130 w/ RTTS plug BHA. M/U pup joint for space out and connected TDS. Placed RTTS packer at 131,5m (middle element). Filled pipe and broke circulation. Recorded up/down weights 88t/84t. Losses 1,6m3/hour</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-07T18:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-07T18:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">132</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mechanical plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Set RTTS Plug at 131,5m (middle element). Closed UPR on BOP and lined up cement unit for pressure test below RTTS via drill string. Losses stopped after RTTS packer was set</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-07T18:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-07T19:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">132</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mechanical plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pressure tested the surface lines to 125 bar/ 10 min. Attempted to pressure test surface cement plug below RTTS plug. Pressure broke at around 30 bar. Stopped pressuring up. Pressure leaked off.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-07T19:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-07T20:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mechanical plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Released RTTS plug, POOH w/ RTTS BHA, losses 1,6m3/hour</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-07T20:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-07T22:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- mechanical plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>L/D RTTS BHA, R/B 8,25in drill collars. Cleaned drill floor</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-07T22:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-07T22:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting to N/D diverter</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-07-07T22:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-07-08T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Removed elevators and rotator. Attached chains to bails. Installed lifting eyebolts to diverter. Pulled diverter to rig floor, 11,5t overpull to come free.Installed outer ring and master bushing</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
